  "title": "Dodge and Under Armour Unleash a High-Octane Collection",
  "summary": "Dodge and Under Armour today announce a bold new collaboration for those who move fast, hit hard, and refuse to be outworked. Spanning apparel, footwear and accessories, the collection draws inspiration from the iconic Dodge Charger SRT Hellcat and Dodge Challenger SRT Demon — machines that roar with the same intensity athletes live by on and off the field. The result is classic Americana reimagined, where legacy horsepower meets next-generation performance.",
